      ],
      "raw": "Use this template to generate barcodes in bulk for existing customers. The template reads customer identifiers from a source file and calls the Capillary barcode generation API for each record.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Use this template to generate barcodes in bulk for existing customers. The template reads customer identifiers from a source file and calls the Capillary barcode generation API for each record.",
